---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About"
  description="SPX Arena is an educational website that explores how famous investors, funds, and ETFs actually perform and helps people understand how investing works."
  showSources={false}
>
  <main class="about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <header class="about-intro">
      <span class="small-label">THE PURPOSE BEHIND THE ARENA</span>
      <h1 id="about-title">About <em>SPX Arena</em></h1>
      <p class="about-lead">
        Understand the performance.<br />Learn how investing works.
      </p>
      <p class="about-mission">
        SPX Arena’s main purpose is education. We help people see how famous
        investors, funds, and ETFs actually perform, then use those real-world
        records to make investing easier to understand.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="about-chapter" aria-labelledby="about-records-title">
      <div class="about-chapter-heading">
        <span class="about-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2 id="about-records-title">Look beyond<br />the famous name.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-chapter-copy">
        <p>
          A familiar face or a popular fund can attract attention. We want to
          make the record behind that reputation easier to explore: how an
          investment performed, over what period, and how it compared with the
          S&amp;P 500, represented here by the SPY ETF.
        </p>
        <p>
          The returns shown belong to the named fund, investment strategy, or
          company associated with a person—not their personal portfolio. Each
          comparison identifies what is being measured and links to its sources.
          Where a comparable record is missing, a profile stays unranked.
        </p>
        <div class="about-links">
          <a href="/leaderboard/"
            >Explore the leaderboard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
          <a href="/etfs-arena/"
            >Compare ETFs <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-chapter" aria-labelledby="about-learning-title">
      <div class="about-chapter-heading">
        <span class="about-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2 id="about-learning-title">Make sense of<br />the numbers.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-chapter-copy">
        <p>
          The rankings are a starting point for learning. The site introduces
          benchmarks, index funds, ETFs, diversification, risk, and compounding
          through explanations and interactive examples.
        </p>
        <p>
          Explore the investing guide to build a foundation, then use the
          calculator to see how changing time, contributions, and assumed
          returns changes a hypothetical outcome. The goal is to help you ask
          better questions and understand what the numbers mean.
        </p>
        <div class="about-links">
          <a href="/what-is-spx/"
            >Learn the basics <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
          <a href="/calculator/"
            >Try the calculator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="about-context" aria-labelledby="about-context-title">
      <span class="small-label">KEEP THE RECORD IN CONTEXT</span>
      <h2 id="about-context-title">Education comes first.</h2>
      <p>
        SPX Arena is an independent educational project. Rankings describe the
        historical periods shown; they are not recommendations to buy or sell.
        Past performance does not guarantee future results, and calculator
        projections are hypothetical. The current performance snapshot runs
        through December 31, 2025.
      </p>
      <a href="/credits/"
        >Sources, credits &amp; independence <span aria-hidden="true">→</span
        ></a
      >
    </aside>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-page {
    max-width: 1152px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 64px 36px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-intro {
    max-width: 780px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-intro h1 {
    margin: 20px 0 28px;
    font: 300 clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px)/1.1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-intro h1 em {
    color: var(--brand);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-lead {
    color: var(--brand);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-mission {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--soft);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-chapter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.65fr);
    gap: 64px;
    padding-block: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #816b33;
    font:
      12px/1.6 'IBM Plex Mono',
      monospace;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-chapter h2 {
    font: 300 clamp(26px, 3vw, 32px)/1.25 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: -0.7px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-chapter-copy p,
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--soft);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-chapter-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 28px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-page a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--brand);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--gold-edge);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 32px 36px;
    background: #edf1e8;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-edge);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    color: var(--brand);
    font: 400 24px/1.3 var(--sans);
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context p {
    max-width: 850px;
  }
  :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context a {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-page {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-intro {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-intro h1 {
      letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    }
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-chapter {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      padding-block: 32px;
    }
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-number {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    :global(#spx-nine-in-ten) .about-context {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
